And they, you know, they clearly like designed with it in mind.

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:40.790
I think in Zelda 2, you don't really like break away from the same view.

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:53.250
In this, when you talk to any character, be they in a hut or in the overworld, it snaps you into a different more, you know, like there's a bunch of different frames going on inside of the inside of the.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:13:03.910
Sure. I guess I'm just like what was stopping those other games from just having the text box and then scroll to the next text box and in the next text box until everything you want to say is said.

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:04.930
Oh, yeah, that's a good point.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:06.770
