Yeah, and before this, I was kind of just under the impression that there was like this weird limitation of the NES that like you couldn't have as many characters or whatever, which when I look back at it, like it doesn't really add up because you can obviously do things that are more robust than text.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:24.830
