01:04:35.210 --> 01:04:36.130
a little sped up.

01:04:37.030 --> 01:04:37.870
Kind of, yeah,

01:04:37.870 --> 01:04:38.810
that got kind of annoying.

01:04:39.030 --> 01:04:40.050
Especially because there's some really,

01:04:40.250 --> 01:04:41.750
really good music later in the game.

01:04:41.930 --> 01:04:43.310
But, definitely not enough

01:04:43.310 --> 01:04:44.550
to, like, put even,

01:04:44.710 --> 01:04:45.570
like, one,

01:04:46.130 --> 01:04:47.450
you know, a mark against it

01:04:47.450 --> 01:04:48.410
for me. Now, Joe,

01:04:53.050 --> 01:04:53.970
that track and then when you're

01:04:53.970 --> 01:04:55.230
in the dungeons you're only ever hearing

01:04:55.230 --> 01:04:56.290
the dungeon track. So,

01:04:56.470 --> 01:04:57.670
you know, that game, what,

01:04:57.770 --> 01:04:59.010
should I take a point off of it too?

01:04:59.010 --> 01:05:00.070
Is it not a 10 out of 10

01:05:00.070 --> 01:05:01.310
because the music's kind of repetitive?

01:05:01.410 --> 01:05:03.270
Yeah, right. I'm gonna take it,

01:05:03.310 --> 01:05:04.110
I'm gonna vote to take it

01:05:04.110 --> 01:05:05.010
